      "raw": "<p>Well now, something new? What a non-specific holiday treat!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Oh boy, I hope that hell chorus \"Welcome to the Bullpen!\" opening is not going to be a thing, that was creepy. XD</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Wait, Gloomweaver's over 10,000 years old... and Zhu Long is&nbsp;<em>older?</em>&nbsp;o.o Did we know this? I mean, I know he's old, but I feel like this is the first time this comparison has been made! Or maybe I just forgot, I'm good at that.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So what McBehrer is saying is that Christopher is Inversiverse Fashion? I'm up for this.</p>",
